hpc:SlurmWorkloadManager a owl:Class .
hpc:SchedMD a owl:Class .

hpc:Version a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:Overview a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:ReleaseNotes a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:Using a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:Documentation a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:FAQ a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:Publications a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:Installing a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:Download a owl:ObjectProperty .
